# The remote targets do not read from the build context. Direct local-target
# builds only need a distribution staged as java-tron/.
*
!java-tron/
!java-tron/**

# Never send credentials or private configuration, including files placed in
# an otherwise allowed staged distribution.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.pkcs12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*keystore*.json
**/private_net_config.conf
**/credentials
**/credentials.*
**/secrets
**/secrets.*

# Runtime state may contain node identity, wallet, or transaction data and is
# never part of a supported image build context.
**/Wallet
**/Wallet/**
**/database*
**/gc.log
**/logs
**/logs/**
**/nodeId.properties
**/output-directory
**/output-directory/**
**/tron-data
**/tron-data/**
**/vm_trace
**/vm_trace/**
